00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:57.440
Ayako. I don't have any special skills,
so I can't say I understand your world
but if you're suffering, or in pain,
you can always come home!!!

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:01.700
Sis...

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:03.960
I should go back to
the world I knew before.

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:07.000
I know I was just chasing after dreams
that would never come true.

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:13.470
But it was nice to get a little closer
to a world where they did.

00:19:13.470 --> 00:19:15.970
Yamada-<i>san</i>! You're in there, right?

00:19:15.970 --> 00:19:18.300
I have to tell you something!

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:20.720
Onodera-<i>sensei</i>, what are you doing?

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:23.520
You know only students
are allowed to be here!

00:19:23.520 --> 00:19:25.350
This is an emergency!
Pretend I'm not here!

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:27.400
Men are strictly forbidden from--

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:30.860
Well, I'm a beautiful Kouka girl
on the inside!

00:19:30.860 --> 00:19:34.530
Listen, Yamada-<i>san</i>.
You're a sweet and sensitive girl.

00:19:34.530 --> 00:19:37.700
You must keep all your worries
to yourself, right?

00:19:37.700 --> 00:19:39.700
But you're still so young!
You have so much time

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:41.330
to decide what you want from life!

00:19:41.330 --> 00:19:44.620
It's totally normal to lose faith
or stumble here and there!

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:47.880
You might be the bottom of the class,

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:53.510
but you're miles ahead of the other
1,095 girls who didn't get in!

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:56.300
The Kouka Troupe only opens
to its chosen maidens!

00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:59.220
And they only open for them just once!

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:05.270
Once you walk out, you can never go back!

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:08.730
I don't want you to quit, not yet!

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:12.320
I know you're forgetting
something important.

00:20:12.320 --> 00:20:16.400
Girls with <i>nothing </i>to offer
don't get into Kouka!

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:20.410
Please, remember for me. What is it
you have? What's your special talent?

00:20:21.330 --> 00:20:23.120
My voice?

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:24.830
That's right, your voice!

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:27.660
You know what I thought
when I heard your voice?

00:20:27.660 --> 00:20:31.250
I thought, this girl's going to be
the next great etoile of our time!

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:34.380
Imagine you, on stage during
the grand finale of a Kouka show,

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:36.630
standing in the center of those big stairs

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:39.760
and singing acapella
with your beautiful voice!

00:20:45.810 --> 00:20:48.520
Okay, girls! Today, we're going to
work on our sight--

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:50.270
Sorry I'm late!

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:52.650
Oh, Yamada-<i>san</i>!
Are you okay to sing again?

00:20:52.650 --> 00:20:58.030
Yes, sir. My doctor gave me permission
to come to class again, too!

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:09.040
Well then, why don't we pick up from
where we left off the other day?

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:13.170
Solo time! Let's start with you,
Yamada-<i>san</i>, since you're feeling better!

00:21:13.170 --> 00:21:15.710
Huh? Oh...

00:21:15.710 --> 00:21:18.760
Aya-<i>chan</i>! You can use my sheet music!

00:21:18.760 --> 00:21:20.880
Thanks, Sarasa-<i>chan</i>!

00:21:22.140 --> 00:21:25.470
This is the song I sang
during my audition.

00:21:27.520 --> 00:21:30.810
Okay, Yamada-<i>san</i>, step forward.

00:21:34.610 --> 00:21:38.240
If I don't give up, will it be
just as Onodera-<i>sensei </i>says?

00:21:38.240 --> 00:21:41.360
Will I stand in the center of
those big stairs one day,

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:46.450
getting a huge round of
applause just for myself?

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:49.200
Nobody can say for sure...

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:59.800
I didn't know Aya-<i>chan</i>
could sing like this!

00:21:59.800 --> 00:22:02.220
I had no idea!

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:04.640
She sings like an angel!

00:22:04.640 --> 00:22:09.520
I knew. I was in the same group
as her during auditions.

00:22:09.520 --> 00:22:12.140
The moment she started singing,

00:22:12.140 --> 00:22:15.400
the teachers snapped out of
their dazes to listen.

00:22:15.400 --> 00:22:19.940
It always annoyed me how
she was never really trying in class.

00:22:23.490 --> 00:22:26.280
The one thing I <i>can </i>say...

00:22:28.290 --> 00:22:33.170
...is that if I quit now,
that's really the end.

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:39.630
Hey, I have to apologize.

00:22:39.630 --> 00:22:44.380
You were worried about me, Narata-<i>san</i>,
and I just snapped at you.

00:22:44.380 --> 00:22:46.100
I'm really sorry!

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:46.930
It's fine.

00:22:46.930 --> 00:22:47.760
Huh?

00:22:47.760 --> 00:22:51.520
I haven't spent much time
with other people before,

00:22:51.520 --> 00:22:53.940
so I was probably too blunt.

00:22:53.940 --> 00:22:58.360
Everyone says I act like a robot, or that
they don't know what I'm thinking.

00:22:58.360 --> 00:23:00.110
That's not true!

00:23:00.110 --> 00:23:04.280
You're different, Sara-- Watanabe-<i>san</i>.

00:23:04.280 --> 00:23:07.780
But I can't stay like this.
I want to be an actress.

00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:13.160
It's kind of a relief to know that even
<i>you </i>have stuff you worry about, Naracchi.

00:23:15.250 --> 00:23:17.630
Oh, s-sorry.

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:18.630
It's okay.

00:23:18.630 --> 00:23:22.510
Your soprano is so beautiful, Aya-<i>chan</i>!

00:23:22.510 --> 00:23:27.010
I would <i>love </i>to sing like that, but since
Lady Oscar is an <i>otokoyaku</i>-role,

00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:29.010
I won't get to sing soprano.

00:23:29.010 --> 00:23:32.310
Have you always wanted to
play Lady Oscar, Sarasa-<i>chan</i>?

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:34.600
Yeah, ever since I was a kid!

00:23:34.600 --> 00:23:40.070
Oh, though I guess there was a time
when I wanted to play Sukeroku.

00:23:49.650 --> 00:23:54.620
